    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Scavenger delivers golden-era arcade action in a modern roguelike package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.poster.avif?t=1746746334\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.webm?t=1746746334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.mp4?t=1746746334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on the hook for $100,000 space dollars owed to Cervo Corporation for repairing your tractor beam without authorization. There's only one way out of this mess: mine low, sell high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the mineral market with the help of Aimee, your adorable, super-smart AI companion. Read the price charts of the 9 minerals to uncover the secret patterns within, and win big by mining just before a price surge or selling ahead of a crash. Or, trade those rocks for precious ship upgrades to bring home a bigger bounty in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip around asteroids with responsive, momentum-based controls, and blast them apart with 4 distinct weapons. Then, suck up all the dropped loot with your trusty tractor beam. But beware: you're not the only one after these rocks. Pirate drones lurk in every system, ready to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your journey be the ultimate rags-to-riches story, or will you be crushed by your financial burdens? Find out in <strong>Star Scavenger</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Scavenger delivers golden-era arcade action in a modern roguelike package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.poster.avif?t=1746746334\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.webm?t=1746746334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602530/extras/8b53bd8ec2d541b98c06a0521a59e526.mp4?t=1746746334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on the hook for $100,000 space dollars owed to Cervo Corporation for repairing your tractor beam without authorization. There's only one way out of this mess: mine low, sell high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the mineral market with the help of Aimee, your adorable, super-smart AI companion. Read the price charts of the 9 minerals to uncover the secret patterns within, and win big by mining just before a price surge or selling ahead of a crash. Or, trade those rocks for precious ship upgrades to bring home a bigger bounty in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip around asteroids with responsive, momentum-based controls, and blast them apart with 4 distinct weapons. Then, suck up all the dropped loot with your trusty tractor beam. But beware: you're not the only one after these rocks. Pirate drones lurk in every system, ready to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your journey be the ultimate rags-to-riches story, or will you be crushed by your financial burdens? Find out in <strong>Star Scavenger</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dig your way out of debt. Star Scavenger is a roguelike top-down shooter about blasting asteroids to get the precious minerals inside. Scavenge, dodge pirates, and beat the market to free yourself from an unjust punishment.",
